l HTTP API for transferring files and clipboard content from any network-connected\ndevice to your Windows PC. Any HTTP-capable client can use it — automation tools\nlike Android Tasker, command-line utilities like curl, scripts, or custom apps.\nNo cloud service, no account, no setup beyond the app itself.\n\nFeatures:\n- Local HTTP API on port 2560 — receive files, read and write the clipboard\n- Bearer token authentication (optional)\n- mDNS/Bonjour auto-discovery for iOS companion app\n- Minimize to tray with live status indicator\n- Auto-update via GitHub Releases\n- Start with Windows option","moniker":"pigeonpost","name":"PigeonPost","packageUrl":"https://github.com/holgerimbery/PigeonPost","publisher":"Holger Imbery","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/holgerimbery","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/holgerimbery/PigeonPost/releases/tag/v1.5.11","tags":["clipboard","file-transfer","http-api","mdns","tray","windows"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/holgerimbery","releaseDate":"2026-05-13","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/holgerimbery/PigeonPost/releases/tag/v1.5.11","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/h/HolgerImbery/PigeonPost/1.5.11/HolgerImbery.PigeonPost.yaml","sha256":"cc8d670bec2f0a6ab6faa31e141f24fe6475bfcb0f64bedfc3265bedf97e6d31"},{"path":"manifests/h/HolgerImbery/PigeonPost/1.5.11/HolgerImbery.PigeonPost.installer.yaml","sha256":"b231bea56071ec245b9d634bc8228f974019ddf15e472374d9a335df91cf0143"},{"path":"manifests/h/HolgerImbery/PigeonPost/1.5.11/HolgerImbery.PigeonPost.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"165ea80f98eb002f5c3ba4a0a83bb419ad18f0bb86a831dbc37ab3e06f62212f"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"1.5.11"}